WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The owner approves an external check of gateway.example.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The gateway accepts a connection on TCP port 443.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The TLS certificate matches the hostname and expires in 12 days.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
The network team plans a renewal and a follow-up check.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Proposed monitoring compares 12 days of validity with 365 after renewal.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
In a separately approved exercise, an engineer would verify the block and the alert.
